[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_l04w2")
dialogue_id = "debate_hedonism"
record_title = "Debate Speech: Hedonism"
text = "PAGE: scribe(PORTAL_NETWORK), AUDIENCE
scribe: We often hear of shards that have achieved material abundance, and many a voice sings praises for these achievements.
scribe: But let us examine deeply the cost of such mundane success.
scribe: The Explorer brings us tales of a shard whose granaries perpetually overflow.
scribe: Freed from the struggle for survival, what monumental works did these people pursue?
scribe: What higher truths did they seek?
scribe: They sought nothing but the perfection of their next meal.
scribe: They abandoned the teachings of the Enlightened One to build shrines celebrating intoxicants.
scribe: They spend their days debating the thickness of noodles, while their spirits languish in comfortable apathy.
scribe: This is the insidious danger of a purely material collective.
scribe: Lacking a guiding light to inspire higher thought, the mind degrades into base hedonism.
scribe: It replaces the pursuit of lasting beauty and worthwhile achievements with the fleeting satisfaction of a full stomach.
scribe: We were not saved from the Shattering to become well-fed beasts.
scribe: We must unite under a higher mandate, so our prosperity may elevate our spirits, rather than merely sate our appetites."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://jtkfcsyiryo4"
